                <mxCell id="16" value="The db layer persists an instance of a couchdb database. Only the data layer reaches it (platform NetworkPolicy, 5984); the admin UI is reached with kubectl port-forward rather than an ingress.&#10;&#10;Since 2026-10-27 it runs with a read-only root filesystem: an init container seeds /opt/couchdb/etc into an emptyDir and gives Erlang a cookie in vm.args. Deployed from nineteenseventytwo-platform apps/eightbitsaxlounge." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
